# Keep the Docker build context minimal and leak-free.
# (The Dockerfile only COPYs backend/ and frontend/ — this is defense in depth:
# local .env files, test databases and caches must NEVER enter the image.)
.git
.env
backend/.env
backend/data
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
*.pyc
docs
scripts
proxy
*.md
!README.md
